{% comment %}
  AGHA PDP — THE FRAGRANCE (one art-directed composition, not a card grid)
  An editorial header, then the bottle enlarged and unboxed — no card, no background
  panel, just the product on the page — with the notes and claims reading in toward it
  from either side, close enough to feel like one composition. A faint scent-trail line
  and a few drifting particles on either side are the only decoration; both are purely
  ambient (aria-hidden, no content) and never stand in for real data.

  Data — every value comes from the current product; nothing perfume-specific is written here:
    Top / heart / base .. custom.top_notes / custom.heart_notes / custom.base_notes
                          (comma-separated text, or a list of single-line text)
    Claims .............. custom.claims (list of single-line text, or comma-separated text),
                          plus any product tag written as "claim:Vegan", "claim:Paraben free" …
    Family .............. custom.family, else product.type
  A note block without data is left out. A claim is shown only as an icon and its own
  wording — no description line is invented under it. The section renders nothing when
  the product has no notes and no claims.

  Motion: assets/pdp.js (heading, then the bottle scales up while the trail lines draw in
  and the particles fade on, then the side items read in toward the bottle; the bottle
  also carries a slow, continuous idle drift in CSS, independent of scroll).
  Static without JS (the idle drift and trail/particle reveal are the only things JS adds;
  everything else is visible without it).
{% endcomment %}

{%- capture pdp_json -%}{%- render 'agha-pdp-data' -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign pdp = pdp_json | parse_json -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign image = s.image | default: product.featured_image
  assign family = pdp.family

  comment
    Left column — the three acts, in order, each with a fixed icon.
  endcomment
  assign left_blocks = ''
  for key in (1..3)
    case key
      when 1
        assign field_val = pdp.top_notes
        assign icon = 'leaf'
        assign title = s.top_label
      when 2
        assign field_val = pdp.heart_notes
        assign icon = 'flower'
        assign title = s.heart_label
      when 3
        assign field_val = pdp.base_notes
        assign icon = 'wood'
        assign title = s.base_label
    endcase
    if field_val != blank
      assign text = field_val
      assign left_blocks = left_blocks | append: icon | append: '¦' | append: title | append: '¦' | append: text | append: '~'
    endif
  endfor
  assign left_blocks = left_blocks | split: '~'

  comment
    Right column — claims. Metafield (or, in mock mode with none, demo claims) first, then "claim:" tags; duplicates removed, blanks
    dropped. Icon chosen by keyword match; a claim with no match gets a generic mark, and
    no description line is invented under any of them.
  endcomment
  assign claim_str = ''
  if pdp.claims != blank
    assign claim_str = pdp.claims | join: '|'
  endif
  for t in product.tags
    assign tl = t | downcase
    if tl contains 'claim:'
      assign c = t | split: ':' | last | strip
      assign claim_str = claim_str | append: '|' | append: c
    endif
  endfor
  assign claims_raw = claim_str | split: '|'
  assign claim_list = ''
  for c in claims_raw
    assign cs = c | strip
    if cs != blank
      assign claim_list = claim_list | append: cs | append: '|'
    endif
  endfor
  assign claims = claim_list | split: '|' | uniq

  assign right_blocks = ''
  for c in claims
    assign cl = c | downcase
    assign icon = 'seal'
    if cl contains 'paraben' or cl contains 'phthalate'
      assign icon = 'drop'
    elsif cl contains 'cruelty'
      assign icon = 'heart'
    elsif cl contains 'vegan'
      assign icon = 'leaf'
    elsif cl contains 'last'
      assign icon = 'time'
    elsif cl contains 'premium' or cl contains 'eau de parfum' or cl contains 'extrait'
      assign icon = 'sparkle'
    endif
    assign right_blocks = right_blocks | append: icon | append: '¦' | append: c | append: '~'
  endfor
  assign right_blocks = right_blocks | split: '~'
-%}

{%- if left_blocks.size > 0 or right_blocks.size > 0 -%}
<section class="pdp pdp-section pdp-tf" data-pdp-tf aria-labelledby="tf-{{ section.id }}-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="pdp-tf__head" data-pdp-reveal>
      {%- if s.show_eyebrow -%}<span class="pdp-eyebrow">{{ product.title }}</span>{%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="pdp-tf__title" id="tf-{{ section.id }}-title">{{ s.heading }}</h2>
      {%- if s.subheading != blank -%}<p class="pdp-tf__sub">{{ s.subheading }}</p>{%- endif -%}
    </header>

    <div class="pdp-tf__stage">
      <ol class="pdp-tf__col pdp-tf__col--left">
        {%- for b in left_blocks -%}
          {%- assign parts = b | split: '¦' -%}
          <li class="pdp-tf__block" data-pdp-tf-block data-side="left">
            <span class="pdp-tf__block-icon">{% render 'agha-pdp-icon', icon: parts[0] %}</span>
            <span class="pdp-tf__block-copy">
              <span class="pdp-tf__block-title">{{ parts[1] }}</span>
              {%- if parts[2] != blank -%}<span class="pdp-tf__block-text">{{ parts[2] }}</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>

      <div class="pdp-tf__center">
        <div class="pdp-tf__aura" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg class="pdp-tf__wave pdp-tf__wave--left" viewBox="0 0 220 420" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M210 16C150 70 168 130 118 168 70 204 96 264 70 316 52 352 60 388 96 408" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <svg class="pdp-tf__wave pdp-tf__wave--right" viewBox="0 0 220 420" preserveAspectRatio="none"><path d="M10 16C70 70 52 130 102 168 150 204 124 264 150 316 168 352 160 388 124 408" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:12%; --y:14%; --s:5px; --d:0s;"></span>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:86%; --y:22%; --s:4px; --d:1.1s;"></span>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:8%; --y:52%; --s:3px; --d:2.4s;"></span>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:90%; --y:60%; --s:5px; --d:0.6s;"></span>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:20%; --y:82%; --s:4px; --d:1.8s;"></span>
          <span class="pdp-tf__particle" style="--x:80%; --y:86%; --s:3px; --d:3s;"></span>
        </div>

        <figure class="pdp-tf__visual" data-pdp-tf-visual>
          <span class="pdp-tf__float">
            <span class="pdp-tf__frame">
              {%- if image -%}
                {%- assign image_alt = image.alt | default: product.title -%}
                {{ image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 1101px) 34vw, (min-width: 769px) 46vw, 82vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: image_alt }}
              {%- endif -%}
            </span>
          </span>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <ol class="pdp-tf__col pdp-tf__col--right">
        {%- for b in right_blocks -%}
          {%- assign parts = b | split: '¦' -%}
          <li class="pdp-tf__block" data-pdp-tf-block data-side="right">
            <span class="pdp-tf__block-icon">{% render 'agha-pdp-icon', icon: parts[0] %}</span>
            <span class="pdp-tf__block-copy">
              <span class="pdp-tf__block-title">{{ parts[1] }}</span>
            </span>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="pdp-tf__caption" data-pdp-reveal>
      <span class="pdp-tf__caption-name">{{ product.title }}</span>{%- if family != blank -%}<span class="pdp-tf__caption-sep" aria-hidden="true">—</span><span class="pdp-tf__caption-family">{{ family }}</span>{%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Agha PDP · The fragrance",
  "class": "pdp-tf-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_eyebrow", "label": "Show product name above the heading", "default": true },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The Fragrance" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "subheading", "label": "Supporting line", "default": "An olfactory journey in three acts." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Bottle image", "info": "Defaults to the product's featured image. A studio shot on white blends into the page." },
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Left column: custom.top_notes, custom.heart_notes, custom.base_notes. Right column: custom.claims (list of single-line text) or product tags written as claim:Vegan — shown as icon + wording only, no invented description. Anything without data is hidden." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Note labels" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "top_label", "label": "Top notes", "default": "Top notes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heart_label", "label": "Heart notes", "default": "Heart notes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "base_label", "label": "Base notes", "default": "Base notes" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Agha PDP · The fragrance" }]
}
{% endschema %}
